    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nWhat effect do fibrates on the lipid fraction?\n\n(1) ↓↓↓ TGs\n(2) ↓ LDL\n(3) ↑ HDL\n\n(↑ HDL by increasing ApoA1 and ApoA2)\n\n[Image: f59c0dc2b29becf974248dc8be4d38a417a17147c4cc0ec14734aee4ae345bcb]\n\n[Image: 9bd88d2d7061fabc1e3fed91d7c0f1c60b6ccf4391bedd43d3be937318a0c22b]\n\n[Image: c0f99bcd8d0ebe6e25817ad3f0347ec8ffeac5e84e55ba778ed5dc07bb135c18]\n\n[Image: c490705868c75943d427842ceda5650559c91d7f3658d22d332f45a3ed90a909]\n\n2.3 - Fibrates, niacin\n[Image: 63bd3cceb197643d542d99ce05740f56271ef101bf9656ff2cd3285da65a40bd]\n\n[Image: bf16291a0c725457edd1166331efc2b998ce1cc7a69fcb222875659bc54aa310]\n\n[Image: 27ea9f4432f520946ba851058b5bb65de4d42ee93077aac6366878f0e27cadf9]\n\n[Image: b64b9ec69b0a386594f0a1c35ab42d5d89763ce28c20b3321978f9ae34fffb8e]\n\n[Image: dc2581a2efba428e54ee33323bb273da420875e5f464134b3d91a6e13e238139]\n\n[Image: 88fd59a1b9ad45c2f2ef18066f5abdc93319f7abd5ea4f04642a36b6c1762e39]",
